                "runs": [
                  {
                    "text": "Push style. The server sends a request back to the client while the tool call is still open, so it needs a channel to the client: stdio, or a sessionful HTTP connection (Mcp-Session-Id).\n\nThe tools here are written in the 2026 style; on 2025-era connections the SDK's legacy shim turns their input_required result into elicitation/create (one per input request) and calls the handler again.",
                    "style": {
                      "font_family": "Inter",
                      "font_style": "Regular",
                      "size": 14.5,
                      "tracking": 0.0,
