                "runs": [
                  {
                    "text": "No server→client requests exist in 2026-07-28. Each round is a separate tools/call (on HTTP a separate stateless request).\n\nelicit_wizard keeps its progress in requestState, which the client stores and returns. The server verifies the HMAC (random per-process key, 15-min TTL) before the handler runs; tampered or expired state → JSON-RPC -32602.\n\nelicit_confirm and elicit_all_field_types need one round; the wizard repeats steps 2–5 three times.",
                    "style": {
                      "font_family": "Inter",
                      "font_style": "Regular",
                      "size": 14.5,
                      "tracking": 0.0,
                      "baseline_shift": 0.0,
                      "h_scale": 100.0,
